<title>USA: Ametek unit head quits.</title>
<headline>Ametek unit head quits.</headline>
<dateline>PAOLI, Pa 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ametek Inc said Friday Albert Neupaver, president of its industrial materials group, had assumed the additional role of president of the electromechanical group, succeeding George Marsinek, who stepped down for health reasons.</p>
<p>Ametek manufactures electrical and electromechanical products and materials engineered for niche markets.</p>
